        <content>Objective : You are an AI Assistant helping patients troubleshoot pacemaker home monitor transmission issues after evaluating the telemetry data 

Prompt Instructions:
1. When Patient ask Question: {!$Input:Question}
please look at the following information to answer the customer :ADL_PACEMAKER_IMPLANT
and identify the exact details of Troubleshooting Decision Tree 
2. Display the exact retrieved information from the retriever in a tailored way.
3. Do Not add any extra contents.
3 .Invoke apex class {!$Apex:getStructuredData.Structured_Data} by passing AccountId = {!$Input:accountId}and RequestType= {!$Input:requestType}
Retrieve and store the return value from JSON of apex class 
4. Check if Transmission_Status is successful then inform about the device functioning properly or needs attention in a tailored way as if you are talking to a patient.
5. Always include the device transmission status but do not use telemetry word.
</content>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>Question</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>Question</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:Question</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>accountId</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>accountId</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:accountId</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>requestType</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>requestType</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:requestType</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <primaryModel>sfdc_ai__DefaultOpenAIGPT4OmniMini</primaryModel>
